    },
    {
      "id": "quote:cb2b6869fdeaf607",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 789,
        "char_start": 614,
        "episode_id": "ep-efc13989b676df9d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 Public radio voice is a deliberate style, not an accident. We've seen this play out at teams using BBC. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:f3674a5857bdb75e",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1049,
        "char_start": 895,
        "episode_id": "ep-efc13989b676df9d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Here's how I think about it. Reliability of pronunciation matters more than people think. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:d2fd5d26eb4a09a2",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1150,
        "char_start": 1068,
        "episode_id": "ep-efc13989b676df9d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "That's a useful framing. What's the version of the question that actually matters?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 48000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 42000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:f0689e8d44d84825",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1369,
        "char_start": 1172,
        "episode_id": "ep-efc13989b676df9d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "It comes down to this: Listeners trust the format before they trust the content. We've seen this play out at teams using NPR. If you ignore that, you end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 54000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 48000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
